</pre> results.plot_messages(); <p>The hysteretic variable <code>z</code> of the Bouc-Wen element is not measured; it is reconstructed from the displacement and acceleration sensors together with the parameters. <code>Abs</code> in the equations is the sympy absolute value, so the CKF sigma points pass through the non-smooth term without a Jacobian.</p>
